vel has its own environment, puzzles, entities, secrets, and challenges. Explore recognizable locations like Level 0 and the Poolrooms alongside many original levels such as Terror Hotel, Grass Rooms, The Bunker Springs, Circus, Soundless Solitude, Red Forest, DinnerParty, and Thalassophobia.\n\nPlay alone or team up with up to six players. Create your own game, join other players through public lobbies Work together, solve puzzles, avoid dangerous entities, and try to reach the end.\n\nEnter the Backrooms now and see if you can complete all 61 levels.\n", "short_description": "Facility Apes 3 is a multiplayer VR Backrooms experience with 61 unique levels to explore, escape, and survive. Play alone or join up to six players, meet others in public lobbies. Solve puzzles, avoid dangerous entities, and work together to find your way through the Backrooms.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Unknown Knowledge", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://unknown-knowledge.com/#privacypoliciesfacilityapes3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unknown Knowledge", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://unknown-knowledge.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "27717437367953040"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri